## Scope note

This suite walks the PLAN's own AC-A1..AC-A7 and AC-A12 (phase 2's
Acceptance Criteria section), not the full PRD AC-1..AC-13 list — phase 1's
AC-1..AC-11/AC-13 suite is already APPROVED at
PRPs/reports/text-search/test-suite.diff and is untouched here.

Per docs/context/methodology.md's declared TDD scope ("Scope of the
practice" + "Browser-API work" split) and this plan's own Notes
("Test-file routing") and Risks table, phase 2 is almost entirely a new
React route/screen and client-only glue (App.tsx wiring, TodayHeader.tsx,
TodayScreen.tsx, api.ts's new `signal` parameter, SearchScreen.tsx) — none
of which carries a dedicated test file anywhere in this codebase
(TodayHeader.tsx, SettingsScreen.tsx, useRoute.ts, useConnectivity.ts all
ship with zero test files too). The plan's own Level 2 validation names
`test/app-route.test.ts` as "the one file this phase touches that carries
automated coverage." This suite honors that boundary: it extends the three
pre-existing pure/shared test files the plan's decidable surface actually
touches (`test/app-route.test.ts` for the new `search` AppRoute codec,
`test/task-filter.test.ts` for `toQuery` finally carrying `q` through a
real caller, `test/search.test.ts` for the amended plan's `shouldSearch`/
`SEARCH_MIN_QUERY_LENGTH` predicate — Task 6's decidable extraction of
AC-A2's threshold gate) and classifies every remaining UI-behavior AC as
OUT_OF_PHASE_SCOPE — not deferred to a later phase, but outside this
project's automated-test scope by established, repeated convention,
verified by the owner's own AC-A12 device pass instead. No AC was found
AMBIGUOUS; no invented component test or production signature was
introduced to manufacture coverage that does not exist in this codebase's
testing strategy.

**Revision note (attempt 2 of 3):** `test-reviewer` returned
`CHANGES_REQUESTED` on attempt 1 with `R-AC-COVERAGE` against AC-A2: the
`<2-characters` gate is a decidable, DOM-free predicate and had been
bundled wholesale into the OUT_OF_PHASE_SCOPE rendering half instead of
being tested. The plan was amended (new Task 6: `src/shared/search.ts`
gains `SEARCH_MIN_QUERY_LENGTH`/`shouldSearch`, stated verbatim in the
plan's own ACTION text) to make the finding fixable without inventing any
signature. AC-A2's decidable half now has real coverage below; every other
AC outcome, every existing ledger row, and this suite's DRAFT status are
unchanged from attempt 1.

